The two public constants _P12_SM4_ROUND_KEYS and _SM4_SBOX are converted
without modification from Python tuples to JSON round_keys and sbox arrays.
No account identifiers, passwords, certificates, private keys, sessions or
private operator profile contents are included. This is application protocol
material distributed in the cited public source, not per-account material.
